      "message": "fix(ui): read setup part alignment in boundary_picks::extend_to_loop\n\nRead each picked entity's pose through setup_align::pose_in instead of\nmodel::transform_of so extend_to_loop selects the most horizontal face in\nthe setup frame, matching how generators resolve picks. Keep\nextend_to_loop delegating to the active setup (matching view_pose) and\nadd extend_to_loop_in for operation-scoped callers (boundary_draft::extend\nand edge_pick::take_loop).\n\nDecision: docs/decisions/2216-extend-to-loop-setup-align.md.\n\nFixes #2216",
